window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-096-54ce41a13d94f80e.json"]={sha256:"54ce41a13d94f80efd8b28a951fbf1e34ca496aa09092eb41ccf0838b444a5ea",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-3b38b41eeb5d3943","url":"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/138200_138299/138212/19.02.00_60/ts_138212v190200p.pdf","title":"ETSI TS 138 212 V19.2.0: NR multiplexing and channel coding","titleEn":"ETSI TS 138 212 V19.2.0: NR multiplexing and channel coding","publisher":"ETSI / 3GPP","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-096","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-096","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-097","referenceUrls":["https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/138200_138299/138211/19.02.00_60/ts_138211v190200p.pdf"],"title":"5G NR 上行功率控制：飽和與頻寬分配","titleEn":"5G NR uplink power control: saturation and bandwidth allocation","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 0.375 input/code bit 與 0.75 input/code bit，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 0.375 input/code bit and 0.75 input/code bit, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋10 dBm與23 dBm，建立nr_power.csv、飽和前後數值、功率餘裕，並完成以下驗收：第二配置不得按26 dBm做鏈路預算；可減少M或降需求再重算，不提供實際發射設定。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 10 dBm and 23 dBm; create nr_power.csv, clipped/unclipped values and power headroom; apply this acceptance decision: Do not budget the second case at26 dBm; reduceM or demand and recalculate offline rather than changing real transmit settings.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 Polar控制通道以有限訊息與校驗位元形成編碼負載；本課只查位元預算，不把碼率計算當Polar解碼器。 展開基準式 (32+16)/128；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：逐欄加總32+16=48，並查128/64傳送位置是否重複或漏填；另列有效訊息比率。 將兩條推導一起存入 polar_budget.csv、CRC掩碼測例、位置映射。","從原理 簡化P=min(Pmax,P0+alpha*PL+10log10M)，區分總功率與每資源功率；省略的閉環補償不可默認為已驗證。 展開基準式 min(23,-80+0.8*100+10*log10(10))；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：先算未截限10與26 dBm，再套上23上限；用功率餘裕欄記第二組缺3 dB。 將兩條推導一起存入 nr_power.csv、飽和前後數值、功率餘裕。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Polar control-channel coding starts from message and check bits; this investigation audits bit budgets rather than implementing a Polar decoder., expand baseline expression (32+16)/128; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Check32+16=48 and inspect128/64 transmitted positions for duplicates or gaps; report message-only rate separately. Save both derivations with polar_budget.csv, CRC-mask fixtures and position mapping.","Starting from Use simplified P=min(Pmax,P0+alpha*PL+10log10M), distinguishing total and per-resource power; omitted closed-loop terms remain unverified., expand baseline expression min(23,-80+0.8*100+10*log10(10)); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Calculate unclipped10/26 dBm before imposing23; mark the second case as3 dB short in the power-headroom column. Save both derivations with nr_power.csv, clipped/unclipped values and power headroom.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-106","referenceUrls":["https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/docs/smb/wireless/CBW-AX/kmgmt3384-wi-fi-6-specific-settings-in-cbw.html"],"title":"Wi-Fi 6 TWT：預約喚醒的電量帳本","titleEn":"Wi-Fi6 TWT: scheduled-wake energy accounting","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 0.375 input/code bit 與 0.75 input/code bit，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 0.375 input/code bit and 0.75 input/code bit, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋4.19 mA與0.998 mA，建立twt_current.csv、服務窗口、待傳資料量，並完成以下驗收：平均2 mA目標由短窗口名義通過；須確認10 ms足以送完排隊資料。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 4.19 mA and 0.998 mA; create twt_current.csv, service windows and queued-data volumes; apply this acceptance decision: The shorter window nominally meets2 mA; verify that10 ms can drain queued data.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 Polar控制通道以有限訊息與校驗位元形成編碼負載；本課只查位元預算，不把碼率計算當Polar解碼器。 展開基準式 (32+16)/128；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：逐欄加總32+16=48，並查128/64傳送位置是否重複或漏填；另列有效訊息比率。 將兩條推導一起存入 polar_budget.csv、CRC掩碼測例、位置映射。","從原理 TWT協調喚醒窗口；平均電流由活躍及睡眠時間加權，還要計喚醒成本與錯過預約的重試。 展開基準式 80*0.05+0.2*0.95；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：逐狀態積分mA*ms再除週期；追加每次喚醒耗電欄，避免把量測尖峰刪掉。 將兩條推導一起存入 twt_current.csv、服務窗口、待傳資料量。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Polar control-channel coding starts from message and check bits; this investigation audits bit budgets rather than implementing a Polar decoder., expand baseline expression (32+16)/128; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Check32+16=48 and inspect128/64 transmitted positions for duplicates or gaps; report message-only rate separately. Save both derivations with polar_budget.csv, CRC-mask fixtures and position mapping.","Starting from TWT coordinates wake windows; average current is time-weighted active/sleep current plus wake overhead and missed-slot retries., expand baseline expression 80*0.05+0.2*0.95; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Integrate mA*ms by state and divide by cycle; add a wake-charge column rather than deleting measured spikes. Save both derivations with twt_current.csv, service windows and queued-data volumes.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-0e90e3978e42dfde","url":"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/138200_138299/138211/19.02.00_60/ts_138211v190200p.pdf","title":"ETSI TS 138 211 V19.2.0: NR physical channels and modulation","titleEn":"ETSI TS 138 211 V19.2.0: NR physical channels and modulation","publisher":"ETSI / 3GPP","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-13b3660079bbb9ca","url":"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/docs/smb/wireless/CBW-AX/kmgmt3384-wi-fi-6-specific-settings-in-cbw.html","title":"Wi-Fi 6 specific settings: OFDMA, MU-MIMO, BSS coloring and TWT","titleEn":"Wi-Fi 6 specific settings: OFDMA, MU-MIMO, BSS coloring and TWT","publisher":"Cisco","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
